# ============ Subject (50 chars max) ============
# <type>(<scope>): <subject>


# =================== Body (72 chars per line max) ===================



Fixes/resolves/closes #<issue number>

# Don't forget to use git commit -s for DCO sign-off

# --- Commit Message Guidelines ---
# Type: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test, chore
# Scope: ebuild, core, docs, ci, etc.
# Subject: Imperative mood, no capitalization, no period
# Body: Explain WHAT and WHY, not HOW
